\"\u003ehttps://www.dw.com/en/german-men-need-military-permit-for-extended-stays-abroad/a-76662677\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639976\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639976\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 337\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 564\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://www.dw.com/en/german-men-need-military-permit-for-extended-stays-abroad/a-76662677","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639976","date_published":"2026-04-04T15:39:10Z","author":{"name":"L_226","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=L_226"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639779","title":"Show HN: sllm – Split a GPU node with other developers, unlimited tokens","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eRunning DeepSeek V3 (685B) requires 8×H100 GPUs which is about $14k/month. Most developers only need 15-25 tok/s. sllm lets you join a cohort of developers sharing a dedicated node. You reserve a spot with your card, and nobody is charged until the cohort fills. Prices start at $5/mo for smaller models.\u003cp\u003eThe LLMs are completely private (we don't log any traffic).\u003cp\u003eThe API is OpenAI-compatible (we run vLLM), so you just swap the base URL. Currently offering a few models.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639779\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639779\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 113\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 63\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://sllm.cloud","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639779","date_published":"2026-04-04T15:18:58Z","author":{"name":"jrandolf","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=jrandolf"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47639727","title":"When legal sports betting surges, so do Americans' financial problems","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticl